{
  "info": {
    "name": "Healthcare RAG API",
    "description": "## Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Clinical Medication Intelligence\n\nThis API indexes five healthcare corpora and answers clinical questions grounded in retrieved evidence, with source citations and hallucination detection.\n\n### Corpus Shards\n| Shard | Source | DynamoDB Table |\n|---|---|---|\n| `medications` | Synthea Coherent dataset | `medications` |\n| `fda-labels` | FDA OpenFDA API | derived from `medications` |\n| `snomed` | UMLS Metathesaurus | `conditions` |\n| `loinc` | Regenstrief LOINC table | `observations` |\n| `guidelines` | WHO / NIH PDFs | external URL |\n\n### Authentication\nAll `/rag/*` endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>`. Obtain a token from `POST /login` on the Flask backend (port 4001). `GET /health` is open.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "healthcare-rag-api-v1"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{RAG_JWT}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "RAG_BASE_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:4005",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "RAG_JWT",
      "value": "<paste-jwt-from-POST-/login>",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "PATIENT_ID",
      "value": "8b0484cd-3dbd-8b8d-1b72-a32f74a5a846",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "PHARMACIST_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:4006",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "EHR_QUERY_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:4007",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "DIAGNOSIS_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:4008",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
